SOAPBOX: Got on to hand out a few contacts. SSB is more difficult with my rain
SOAPBOX: gutter antenna than CW. Ended up with a dozen contacts vs. over a 100
SOAPBOX: on CW. Activity seemed less than prior years. Only a few strong
SOAPBOX: contest stations received, and they seemed to call many unanswered
SOAPBOX: CQs. KUDOs to N2CEI FL and K3ZM VA for my best DX from Kansas. N2CEI
SOAPBOX: had a strong, consistent signal and heard well. Copied XE1RCS and
SOAPBOX: ZF2VE well, but no luck with them. AB6GS was a surprise from Wyoming.
